WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.925
Pulmonary rehabilitation in practice.

2
00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:07.577
What a programme includes, who should be referred and the outcomes to expect.

3
00:00:08.027 --> 00:00:13.728
Stopping smoking, vaccination and pulmonary rehabilitation have the largest impact on outcomes.

4
00:00:14.178 --> 00:00:21.910
Long-acting bronchodilators are the foundation; inhaled steroids are added for selected patients with exacerbations and raised eosinophils.

5
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.787
Each exacerbation accelerates decline.

6
00:00:25.237 --> 00:00:28.395
Early recognition and a rescue plan reduce admissions.
